sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements BinaryPipePatternReceiveResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements BinaryPipePatternReceive]

    Product->>CN: BinaryPipePatternReceive.ReceiveData(<br>subchannel=1, sizeBytes=1024, pattern=0xA5)

    alt Data matches pattern
        CN-->>Product: BinaryPipePatternReceiveResponse.ReceiveSuccess(ms=125)
    else Data or channel error
        CN-->>Product: BinaryPipePatternReceiveResponse.ReceiveError(type=Data)
        Note right of Product: ErrorType.Data means data-related error<br>(e.g. pattern mismatch). Channel means channel error.
    end
